WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.548
Badger, Rat, and Mole arrived at Toad Hall.

2
00:00:19.549 --> 00:00:22.204
"Badger was right," said Mole.

3
00:00:22.205 --> 00:00:24.141
"Look at that."

4
00:00:24.142 --> 00:00:28.333
A shiny car was parked at the house.

5
00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:33.404
It was painted red—Toad's favorite color.

6
00:00:33.405 --> 00:00:36.944
"It sure is big," said Rat.

7
00:00:36.945 --> 00:00:41.538
"I'll knock on the door," said Badger.

8
00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:45.809
But before he could, the door burst open.

9
00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:50.008
"Hello!" shouted Toad, smiling.

10
00:00:50.009 --> 00:00:54.011
Toad wore long gloves and a coat.

11
00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.874
Goggles covered his eyes.

12
00:00:56.875 --> 00:01:00.738
"You are just in time!" said Toad.

13
00:01:00.739 --> 00:01:05.273
"It's time for a ride in my new car!"

14
00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:09.209
The three friends stared at him.

15
00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:12.403
"What a silly outfit!" said Rat.

16
00:01:12.404 --> 00:01:15.072
"What's wrong?" said Toad.

17
00:01:15.073 --> 00:01:18.748
"These are my driving clothes."

18
00:01:18.749 --> 00:01:22.750
"Take him inside," said Badger.

19
00:01:22.751 --> 00:01:26.614
Rat and Mole grabbed Toad.

20
00:01:26.615 --> 00:01:30.677
"Hey, let go of me!" yelled Toad.

21
00:01:30.678 --> 00:01:33.550
He kicked his legs in the air.

22
00:01:33.551 --> 00:01:37.871
They dragged Toad back into his house.

23
00:01:37.872 --> 00:01:41.341
"Now then," Badger said to Toad,

24
00:01:41.342 --> 00:01:45.141
"take off those stupid clothes!"

25
00:01:45.142 --> 00:01:49.776
"I will not!" cried Toad proudly.

26
00:01:49.777 --> 00:01:51.887
"I won't!"

27
00:01:51.888 --> 00:01:55.966
"Boys, take off his things!" Badger said.

28
00:01:55.967 --> 00:01:59.478
The three friends went right to work.

29
00:01:59.479 --> 00:02:04.138
"I'll sit on him," said Rat.

30
00:02:04.139 --> 00:02:07.402
"Here, I've got his gloves," said Mole.

31
00:02:07.403 --> 00:02:11.133
"I've got his goggles," said Badger.

32
00:02:11.134 --> 00:02:13.674
They pulled at his cap and coat.

33
00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:16.417
Toad kicked angrily.

34
00:02:16.418 --> 00:02:19.861
"Ahhh!" screamed Toad.

35
00:02:19.862 --> 00:02:27.040
"What are you doing?"
